OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdry this evening with clear spells.
OL,7,FMist and fog patches redeveloping by
OL,8,Fthe morning away from Cornwall. A
OL,9,Fchillier night than Friday night with
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FMist and fog gradually lift to
OL,13,Fleave some sunshine, before a band of
OL,14,Flow cloud and patchy rain moves south
OL,15,Flater on, clearing by late evening.
OL,16,FTemperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
