OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FStaying mostly fine and dry as high
OL,7,Fpressure continues to dominate.
OL,8,FTurning breezy, especially along the
OL,9,Fcoasts into Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,10,Fnear average but feeling chilly
OL,11,Fovernight.
